{"id":"1237e0c206e03ba5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_IPCProof.md","title":"IPCProof","display":"IPCProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"IPCProof","parameters":["g","z488","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"IPCProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>z488</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：直觉主义命题。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>z488</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ IPCProof g z488 a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FormsI g)\n  (and\n    (@ FmI a)\n    (exists z491\n      (and\n        (@ Seq z488 z491)\n        (and\n          (@ Last z488 a)\n          (forall z489\n            (implies\n              (in z489 z491)\n              (exists z490\n                (and\n                  (@ App z488 z489 z490)\n                  (and\n                    (@ FmI z490)\n                    (or\n                      (in z490 g)\n                      (or\n                        (@ IPCAx z490)\n                        (exists z492\n                          (exists z493\n                            (and\n                            (exists z494 (exists z495 (and (in z494 z489) (and (@ App z488 z494 z495) (= z495 z492)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z496 (exists z497 (and (in z496 z489) (and (@ App z488 z496 z497) (= z497 z493)))))\n                            (@ PImp z492 z490 z493)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315c023b0374de7d\" href=\"?note=315c023b0374de7d\" title=\"ZFC_FmI\">FmI</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08bae348e041d0d6\" href=\"?note=08bae348e041d0d6\" title=\"ZFC_FormsI\">FormsI</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"328ce1732932c40d\" href=\"?note=328ce1732932c40d\" title=\"ZFC_IPCAx\">IPCAx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ IPCProof g z488 a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_IPCAx|IPCAx]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmI","status":"resolved","id":"315c023b0374de7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":